  "summary": "Molakalmuru Saree, also known as Karnataka Kanchipuram, is the traditional silk saree that is woven in Molakalmuru, Chitradurga district, Karnataka, India.",
  "description": "Molakalmuru Saree, also known as Karnataka Kanchipuram, is the traditional silk saree that is woven in Molakalmuru, Chitradurga district, Karnataka, India. In 2011, it was granted a Geographical Indication tag and its tag number is 53. The motifs include that of fruits, animals, and flowers.",
